      "notes": "Uses Ollama OpenAI-compatible /v1 API on the Mac host (OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://host.docker.internal:11434). Native lmChatOllama streams tool calls and often yields empty output/intermediateSteps with qwen2.5. Timeout 600s for multi-step MCP agent runs. Faster alternative model: qwen2.5:3b."
